<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:10%; font-size:9pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify">(f)&#8195;&#8195;If the Subscriber is an excepted investment company (<I>i.e.</I>, excluded from the definition of
