<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:2%; font-size:9pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(6)&#8195;&#8195;<U>Investments of Parents and Subsidiaries</U>. A company may include Investments owned by majority-owned subsidiaries of the
